	- the error is defined in 3D, not in the image. The camera finds the cube in pixels, then pixel_to_world converts that to a 3D world position using depth and the calibrated intrinsics. The robot then plans a Cartesian path (pre-grasp → grasp → lift) to that estimated 3D point.
